OL,3,GNEWSACouncil names square after Sir
OL,4,ABilly Boston
OL,5,
OL,6,FRugby League star Sir Billy Boston is
OL,7,Fto be further honoured in his adopted
OL,8,Fhometown Wigan, with the renaming of
OL,9,Fthe town's square where his statue is
OL,10,Fsituated.
OL,12,FSir Billy, who was Rugby league's first
OL,13,Fknight, died last month, aged 92. His
OL,14,Ffuneral took place at Wigan Warriors'
OL,15,FBrick Community Stadium on Thursday.
OL,17,FBelieve Square will now be called Sir
OL,18,FBilly Boston Square "to ensure his
OL,19,Flegacy continues" in the heart of the
OL,20,Ftown, Wigan Council has announced.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
